 "strings": {
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Let me try moving this.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I knew it! I'll put a bug here.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Found an outlet. But...\nthere aren't any open spots.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(How many phones do they have\non this thing!?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Dammit. I'll have to look for\nanother one.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Kaito-san taught me how to pray\nwith one of these years ago.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Bow twice, clap twice, then bow again.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(He said you can't call yourself Japanese\nunless you know how to do it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I don't think these Matsugane guys are spilling\ntheir family secrets to the gods, though.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(All right, that should do it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Could use another,\nbut this is probably fine.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Actually, I feel kinda unsatisfied.\nI'll put one in Matsugane-san's room, just in case.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Great. I'll put one here, too.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There's a cord coming from behind this potted plant. Is there an outlet back there?)</color>": "",
  "Hey, it's Yagami.\nCan you hear me?": "",
  "Loud and clear.\nNow hurry up and get your ass down here.": "",
  "Yep, loud and clear.\nNow get your ass over here.": "",
  "The hell're you doing, Tashiro?": "",
  "Hey, Tashiro!\nThe hell are you doing?": "",
  "You know no goin' in the boss's room without\npermission. If anything happened, it'd be on me.": "",
  "You know no goin' in the boss's room without permission.\nIf anything happened, it'd be on me.": "",
  "The hell're you ignoring me for!?\nSay something, dammit!": "",
  "Hey, you think you can ignore me!?\nSay something, dammit!": "",
  "Guess I'm busted, huh?": "",
  "Awww hell. Guess I'm busted.": "",
  "(Damn. He got back\nfaster than I thought.)": "",
  "You got balls climbin' into the lion's mouth\nknowing you're just gonna get eaten.": "",
  "You got balls climbin' into the lion's mouth,\nknowing you're just gonna get eaten!": "",
  "Don't let this asshole leave here alive!": "",
  "Don't let him leave alive!\nGet him!": "",
  "(Now's my chance!)": "",
  "Heh, you're not getting away that easy!\nSay your prayers, shithead!": "",
  "Whoa, we have laws against\nthose you know!": "",
  "Hey, hold on!\nThere are laws about those things!": "",
  "Laws! Says the guy who's trespassing!": "",
  "Laws, huh!?\nSays the guy who's trespassing!": "",
  "Dammit, how am I gonna\nget out of this...?": "",
  "Dammit, what now...?": "",
  "That'll work!": "",
  "That was a close one, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Did you cut the lights back there?": "",
  "Was that you?\nDid you cut the lights?": "",
  "Yup, heard everything thanks to the bugs.\nFlipped the breaker at the last second.": "",
  "Thanks, Sugiura.\nYou saved my life.": "",
  "Nice... It saved my life.": "",
  "Won't be saved for long if we stick\naround here. Let's get moving!": "",
  "Won't be saved for long if we stick around here.\nLet's get moving!": "",
  "Think we're safe now. What about the bugs?\nCan you hear what they're saying?": "",
  "Gimme a sec.": "",
  "That's all it takes?": "",
  "That's all you need?": "",
  "Yup. Well, everything seems fine.": "",
  "Yup... Well, everything <font_kind=yakuza_italic>seems</font_kind> fine.": "",
  "Huh? Sounds like they're\nmakin' a call already.": "",
  "...To the man of the hour himself. Hamura.\nThey're reporting what just went down.": "",
  "Oh man. To the man of the hour, Hamura.\nThey're reporting what just went down.": "",
  "Can you tell where he's hiding?": "",
  "Can you tell where Hamura's hiding?": "",
  "One sec...": "",
  "Uh, something about \"cho-han\"?": "",
  "Huh? What's \"cho-han\"?": "",
  "Isn't that some kinda dice game?": "",
  "The dice game?": "",
  "Guess he's at a gambling hall, then.\nBut where can you play cho-han?": "",
  "At a Kamurocho gambling hall, then.\nBut where can you play cho-han?": "",
  "If we wanna gamble,\nall we have to do is ask a gambler.": "",
  "If we wanna gamble,\nwe ask a gambler.": "",
  "And I think I know just the spot.": "",
  "We'd better head to a casino.\nAnd I think I know just the spot.": "",
  "Oh, you mean the casino?\nThe one under Koi Bride!": "",
  "Oh, the basement casino?\nUnder Koi Bride!": "",
  "Somebody there has to know where\nto find cho-han in this town.": "",
  "Gotta be someone there\nwho knows cho-han places.": "",
  "For sure.\nGuess in that case...": "",
  "For sure. Guess in that case...": "",
  "Yeah. I'll handle it from here.": "",
  "Thanks for the backup, though.": "",
  "Thanks, though.\nYou did good.": "",
  "(No better place to find\navid gamblers.)": "",
  "(Time to start looking, I guess.\nJust need someone who'll know where to play cho-han.)": "",
  "Fucking shit! Look at the ass on her!": "",
  "Fucking 'a!\nLook at the ass on her!": "",
  "(He's certainly not here to play cards...\nHow'd he even know about this place?)": "",
  "(Maybe I should see if\nhe knows anything.)": "",
  "Hey, sorry to interrupt.": "",
  "Hm? Whaddya want?": "",
  "Know anywhere around here\na guy can play some cho-han?": "",
  "Know anywhere in Kamurocho\na guy can play some cho-han?": "",
  "Cho-han, huh?": "",
  "Yeah, I think there's a joint in the Champion District.\nHeard they're exclusive as all fuck.": "",
  "Yeah, think there's a joint in the Champion District.\nHeard they're pretty damn exclusive.": "",
  "You actually know a place?\nCould you maybe tell me the name?": "",
  "Whoa, you actually know a place?\nCould you maybe tell me the name?": "",
  "Hmmm. I could, sure. But...": "",
  "Hmmm. I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>could</font_kind>, sure, but...": "",
  "Check her out.\nThat chick's got the goods, right?": "",
  "Check her out!\nAin't that the juiciest ass you've ever seen?": "",
  "Uh, sure. I guess she's got... goods.\nWhat's your point?": "",
  "Uh, sure. I guess it's pretty... juicy.\nWhat's your point?": "",
  "I wanna have a drink with her!\nCan you go make introductions for me?": "",
  "I wanna drink with the girl it belongs to.\nThink you could talk to her for me?": "",
  "I have to be your wingman!?": "",
  "The hell? Why can't you do it yourself?": "",
  "Good lookin' guy like you's got a better chance\nof sealin' the deal, right? I mean, look at me.": "",
  "Good lookin' guy like you's got a better chance\nof sealin' the deal. I mean, look at me.": "",
  "Ugh, I can't believe this.\nYou better tell me if I do this for you.": "",
  "Tch, the things I do...\nYou better tell me after all this.": "",
  "Course, man!": "",
  "'Course.": "",
  "(Maybe I'll ask someone else.)": "",
  "Dammit, next game's gonna be mine!": "",
  "(His eyes are bloodshot.\nLooks like he's pretty serious about this.)": "",
  "Not now, dickhead!\nCan't you see I'm in the middle of something!?": "",
  "Shut up!\nCan't you see I'm busy!?": "",
  "It won't take long, promise.": "",
  "Sorry, but it won't take long...": "",
  "Urghhh, I lost again!\nSee what you did!?": "",
  "Urghhh, I lost again!\nDammit, see what you did!?": "",
  "No, I'm pretty sure you\njust have awful luck.": "",
  "I'm pretty sure you just\nhave awful luck.": "",
  "The shit did you say? Let's take\nthis outside, pal. You're gonna pay!": "",
  "The shit did you say?\nLet's take this outside, pal. You're gonna pay!": "",
  "Man, I'm gonna be raking in the cash in no time!\nHow should I spend my newfound wealth...?": "",
  "Man, I'm gonna be raking in the cash in no time!\nHow am I gonna spend all this...?": "",
  "(Looks like he's doing\npretty well.)": "",
  "Huh? It's okay. What's up?": "",
  "Huh? It's okay.\nWhat's up?": "",
  "Know anywhere around here a guy\ncan play some cho-han?": "",
  "Cho-han? Sorry, can't say I do.": "",
  "Oh. Well, thanks anyway.": "",
  "Oh. Well, thanks for trying.": "",
  "This is actually my first time here. The good times\nkeep coming, though! I'm gonna be rich!": "",
  "This is actually my first time here.\nThe good times keep coming, though! I'm gonna be rich!": "",
  "(Typical. He'll be broke\nbefore he knows it.)": "",
  "I'm on a roll!\nTime to go all in!": "",
  "I'm on a roll!\nTime to turn things around!": "",
  "(Huh, this guy doesn't look half bad.)": "",
  "You there!": "",
  "Huh? What?": "",
  "I need cash.\n100 grand'll do the trick!": "",
  "I need 100 grand...\n100 grand'll do the trick!": "",
  "100 grand!?": "",
  "Look man, I'm riding a wave of good luck here.\nI'm about to make some serious bank!": "",
  "(That's a lot of money...)": "",
  "Sorry, I actually don't have enough.": "",
  "There goes my chance...": "",
  "Anyway, there's something\nI wanna ask you.": "",
  "Dammit, no choice but to go all in!": "",
  "Dammit, no choice now\nbut to go all in!": "",
  "He's not even listening to me...": "",
  "(Guess there's no guarantee he'd know, even if\nI lent him the cash. Maybe I'll find someone else.)": "",
  "Here. This is enough, right? ": "",
  "Here. 100 grand, right? ": "",
  "You betcha! Time to reinvest...\nand go all in!": "",
  "You betcha!\nTime to reinvest... and go all in!": "",
  "And he lost.": "",
  "He lost...": "",
  "Fuck! I was so goddamn close\nto winning it all back!": "",
  "By the way, you wouldn't happen to know a place\naround here I could play cho-han, would you?": "",
  "By the way, you wouldn't happen to know\na place around here I could play cho-han, would you?": "",
  "Man, I don't know shit.\nJust leave me alone.": "",
  "(Well, that was a waste of 100k.\nGuess I need to find someone else.)": "",
  "Yeah I'm not letting\nyou gamble my money.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm not letting you\ngamble my money.": "",
  "Then I don't wanna talk to you.\nGet the hell away from me!": "",
  "Ugh, this place sucks.": "",
  "Ugh, this casino is so boring.": "",
  "(Sounds like she's a regular\nat these kinds of places.)": "",
  "(Maybe I should see if\nshe knows anything.)": "",
  "Honey, I ain't selling.": "",
  "No, you can't have my number.": "",
  "...That's not at all\nwhat I'm looking for.": "",
  "I'm not here for that.": "",
  "I heard there's somewhere around here\nI can get in on some cho-han. You know the place?": "",
  "I heard there's somewhere around here I can\nget in on some cho-han. You know the place?": "",
  "Cho-han? Never heard of it.\nIs it any fun?": "",
  "Huh? Probably?": "",
  "Uh... well, probably?": "",
  "I'm in! Take me, take me!\nAnywhere's better than this shithole.": "",
  "I'm in! You gotta take me along for this!\nIt's gotta be better than this place. I need some fun!": "",
  "Gonna have to take a raincheck on that.\nCan't bring you if I don't know where it is.": "",
  "Uh, gonna have to take a raincheck.\nStill can't find the game myself.": "",
  "Well figure it out, then!\nUgh, so bored...": "",
  "Mind if I join you?": "",
  "You come here often?": "",
  "You bet. There's three things I love in life:\nstiff drinks, risky bets...": "",
  "You bet. I come for the drinks,\nthe games, and...": "",
  "...And handsome men.": "",
  "...the handsome men.": "",
  "Handsome, huh?": "",
  "Just once, I want someone to\nseduce me like they do in the movies.": "",
  "I've fantasized about being\nseduced like in the movies... Just once.": "",
  "(This isn't really my thing... but I guess\nthat's how the game is played.)": "",
  "O-Okay, um...\nCan I buy you a drink?": "",
  "Can I buy you a drink?": "",
  "Make it a martini.\nA gambling woman's drink.": "",
  "A martini.\nA gambling woman's drink.": "",
  "Lemme guess. Vodka martini.\nShaken, not stirred.": "",
  "Vodka martini, shaken, not stirred?": "",
  "Right you are. You're a bigger\nmovie buff than I expected.": "",
  "Hehe... Very nice.\nYou know your movies, huh?": "",
  "Mind if I buy you one?\nMy friend'll probably wanna join us, too.": "",
  "Mind if I get you one?\nMy friend'll probably wanna join us, too.": "",
  "Oh, you only want to drink?": "",
  "You only want to drink?": "",
  "I just told you I'm in the gambling mood,\nso what do you say we spice things up a bit?": "",
  "I just told you. I'm in the gambling mood.\nSo let's make the stakes hotter, huh?": "",
  "Here's the deal.\nI'll drink with you if you beat me at poker.": "",
  "If you can beat me in poker,\nI'll drink with you.": "",
  "Okay, it's a deal.": "",
  "Sure, deal.": "",
  "Ain't that just the finest piece\nof grade-A ass you've ever seen?": "",
  "Ain't that just the finest ass you've ever seen?\nGet me in there, man!": "",
  "Well? Are you ready?": "",
  "Wait, you don't have enough chips.\nI can wait, but don't leave a girl hanging.": "",
  "Wait, you don't have enough chips.\nI don't mind waiting, though. Just make it quick.": "",
  "Ah, whoops.\nBe back soon.": "",
  "Oh, this should be good.": "",
  "Heh... I can barely contain\nmy excitement.": "",
  "Hold on a sec.": "",
  "If I must.\nJust be quick about it, hm?": "",
  "If I must.\nJust be quick about it, okay?": "",
  "Seems I lost.": "",
  "Eh, I got lucky.": "",
  "Yes, lady luck seems to prefer her men, \nand I suppose I can't blame her.": "",
  "Yes, poker is a game of chance, after all.\nI guess luck wasn't on my side.": "",
  "And I'm a woman of my word.": "",
  "I'll gladly keep my word, though.": "",
  "Then drinks are on me.": "",
  "Then let's get you that drink.": "",
  "Wonderful.": "",
  "Yes, let's.": "",
  "Seems I won.": "",
  "That's life.\nYou win some, you lose some.": "",
  "Seems so.\nI guess it wasn't in the cards.": "",
  "Well, what a good sport.": "",
  "Well, aren't you a good sport.": "",
  "You know the game pretty well.\nBet you never lose too big, huh?": "",
  "There is something of an art to it, isn't there?\nWhat a team you and I would make.": "",
  "Heh, now that's the real trick to it.\nWe could make quite a duo, you and I.": "",
  "All right. I'll join you for this drink.": "",
  "Lovely, though.\nI'll give you that drink.": "",
  "Really? Great, lemme grab my friend.": "",
  "Really? Great, lemme grab\nmy friend.": "",
  "Hey, why're you the one\nhaving all the fun!?": "",
  "Hey, why're <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> having all the fun!?": "",
  "She agreed to drink with us after a game.\nNow go grab some seats.": "",
  "She said if I played a game, she'd drink with us.\nSo go sit your ass down.": "",
  "Wait, seriously!?\nI owe you for this, man!": "",
  "Seriously!?\nI owe you!": ""
 },
